<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Since you found our company, most likely checked out our site, and reached out to us, my question to you is this?:</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b><u>Are you just looking for education, or are you serious about building a passive income portfolio?</u></b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Aside from publishing free content for newbie investors from time to time, our company,&nbsp;<a href="http://http//www.memphisinvest.com/">Memphis Invest</a>, is the largest and (few would argue) the most respected turnkey company in the country.&nbsp;<a href="http://www.memphisinvest.com/turnkey/passive-income-jumpstart-package?hsCtaTracking=0fc21674-3e2e-447d-8cd8-b4f9f1ef7e48%7Cab3843e5-34d9-4e86-8761-1fc36ed54d13&amp;__hstc=77998027.0e9a112dee6cfd3379e21b0f8df13c2f.1471613800805.1487196209045.1487200310661.35&amp;__hssc=77998027.1.1487200310661&amp;__hsfp=3466644470">You can see 16 short videos right here</a>&nbsp;where our owners discuss their investment strategies and how we assist investors to achieve long term wealth.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Offering rehabbed and rented single family properties in 5 of the best markets in the U.S. for buy and hold investors, we currently manage 4300+ properties for 1500 investors from all over the world.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We offer cash flowing properties between $100-200k in Memphis, Dallas, Houston, with our first properties in Little Rock and Oklahoma City already acquired and going through the rehab process.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We operate in these specific markets because of the affordable price point for available inventory, the high rent-to-price ratio of these markets, and because these states all have very friendly landlord laws.&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you are serious about beginning to build your real estate portfolio,&nbsp;<a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bea0-baba97f6-16a5bdc5-baba97f6-00000003-rfb6cr1entuq8ua17p41php5k6281tia&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1">your next step is to click right here to schedule a call with me</a>. I'll be happy to help you figure out if we are a good fit for you as a company, and if you are a good fit for us as a client.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Take care.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><br></div><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">--&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: small;"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><br><div><span style="font-family: georgia, serif; border-collapse: separate;"><br></span><div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
